{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in over an hour of original music by award-winning composer and music producer Martin Bezjak, created to accompany the wonderfully heartfelt journey of Elroy and Peggie across time and space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This 38-track score blends lush orchestral ambiences, dark Americana textures, emotionally charged melodies, and heart-pounding cinematic climaxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From subtle moments to grand storytelling peaks, the soundtrack captures the full emotional arc of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also featured are two original songs co-written by Tadej Gregorcic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Crimson Sky&quot; feat. Melidah</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Desert Man&quot; feat. \u017dan Videc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With special guest Luka \u0160uli\u0107 on cello.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully mastered for premium listening in both MP3 and 24-bit FLAC formats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/extras/Soundtrack_Loop-Steam.gif?t=1750153656\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786780?t=1750153656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/bab524311a945b52fc40cbaae516605c74e4257b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750153656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/e272d4180ec25412b3f5a6c2ed4c552c5561904e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750153656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/e272d4180ec25412b3f5a6c2ed4c552c5561904e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750153656","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in o